{"artifact":"baggage-json-1702","base":0,"original":"Build an interactive single-bag fee explorer for a fictional policy. Economy allows 23 kg, Business 32 kg; Gold adds 5 kg. Charge $15 per excess kg, never negative. Support all integer bag weights from 10 to 40 kg. Show allowance and fee as inputs change.","previousRequests":[],"currentArtifact":"{
  "version": "2b1",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "For one bag, Gold adds 5 kg to the cabin allowance. You pay $15 per kg over your allowance and $0 if your bag is at or below it."
    },
    {
      "type": "ui",
      "source": "{\"root\":\"layout\",\"elements\":{\"layout\":{\"type\":\"Stack\",\"props\":{},\"children\":[\"cabin\",\"status\",\"weight\",\"allowance\",\"fee\"]},\"cabin\":{\"type\":\"Control\",\"props\":{\"label\":\"Cabin\",\"min\":0,\"max\":1,\"choices\":[\"Economy\",\"Business\"],\"value\":{\"$bindState\":\"/cabin\"}}},\"status\":{\"type\":\"Control\",\"props\":{\"label\":\"Status\",\"min\":0,\"max\":1,\"choices\":[\"No Gold\",\"Gold\"],\"value\":{\"$bindState\":\"/gold\"}}},\"weight\":{\"type\":\"Control\",\"props\":{\"label\":\"Bag weight (kg)\",\"min\":10,\"max\":40,\"choices\":[],\"value\":{\"$bindState\":\"/weight\"}}},\"allowance\":{\"type\":\"Metric\",\"props\":{\"label\":\"Bag allowance (kg)\",\"value\":{\"$computed\":\"Add\",\"args\":{\"a\":{\"$computed\":\"Add\",\"args\":{\"a\":23,\"b\":{\"$computed\":\"Multiply\",\"args\":{\"a\":{\"$state\":\"/cabin\"},\"b\":9}}}},\"b\":{\"$computed\":\"Multiply\",\"args\":{\"a\":{\"$state\":\"/gold\"},\"b\":5}}}}}},\"fee\":{\"type\":\"Metric\",\"props\":{\"label\":\"Single-bag fee ($)\",\"value\":{\"$computed\":\"Multiply\",\"args\":{\"a\":15,\"b\":{\"$computed\":\"Excess\",\"args\":{\"a\":{\"$state\":\"/weight\"},\"b\":{\"$computed\":\"Add\",\"args\":{\"a\":{\"$computed\":\"Add\",\"args\":{\"a\":23,\"b\":{\"$computed\":\"Multiply\",\"args\":{\"a\":{\"$state\":\"/cabin\"},\"b\":9}}}},\"b\":{\"$computed\":\"Multiply\",\"args\":{\"a\":{\"$state\":\"/gold\"},\"b\":5}}}}}}}}}}}}",
      "state": []
    }
  ]
}","controls":[{"type":"Control","props":{"label":"Cabin","min":0,"max":1,"choices":["Economy","Business"],"value":0},"binding":"cabin"},{"type":"Control","props":{"label":"Status","min":0,"max":1,"choices":["No Gold","Gold"],"value":1},"binding":"gold"},{"type":"Control","props":{"label":"Bag weight (kg)","min":10,"max":40,"choices":[],"value":38},"binding":"weight"}],"request":"Add a route selector. Domestic stays the default with the same rules. International adds 2 kg to every allowance. Keep my current selections."}
